    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "NewRoot Learning Institute is a national social impact organization focused on transforming education and community spaces. They specialize in building deep social-emotional learning (SEL) skills in educators to change how young people experience school and how schools serve society."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For over 20 years, NewRoot has been a partner for high schools, districts, and organizations, ensuring students graduate equipped for college, career, and life success."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Over the past year, NewRoot has faced significant technical challenges with their WordPress website, including outages, slow load times, and critical functionality issues affecting their donation page. As their technical partner, Gumbo Media has provided ongoing support to address these concerns while implementing new features that have enhanced their digital presence. Through this collaboration, we've gained deep insight into NewRoot's technical infrastructure and operational needs. To future-proof their platform and better serve their mission, we propose migrating their website from WordPress to Webflow. This strategic shift will not only resolve their current technical pain points but also deliver a more secure, responsive, and user-friendly experience that properly reflects NewRoot's growth and impact in the education sector. The migration represents a crucial step in modernizing their digital infrastructure to support their continued expansion and better serve their community of educators and partners."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3.1. Key Deliverables"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To address these challenges, **Gumbo Media** aims to deliver a comprehensive website migration and modernization solution that will resolve NewRoot's technical issues while positioning them for sustainable growth. Through careful planning and execution, we will:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Transition NewRoot's website from WordPress to Webflow, providing a robust, modern platform that enhances security, simplifies content management, and delivers a seamless user experience."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Migrate NewRoot's existing content, resources, and features to the new platform, ensuring a smooth transition and minimal disruption to their operations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Audit NewRoot's existing tech stack and infrastructure to identify areas for improvement, minimize technical debt, remove unnecessary dependencies, reduce operational costs, and future-proof their web presence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Implement new features and functionality to enhance user engagement and support NewRoot's mission, including a modern, responsive design, improved navigation, and enhanced search capabilities."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Provide ongoing support and maintenance to ensure the website remains secure, performant, and aligned with NewRoot's evolving needs."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3.2. Target Audience"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Educators & School Staff**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Seeking professional development and SEL training resources"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Looking for evidence-based tools and frameworks to transform their teaching practice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Want to connect with a community of like-minded educators"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Need accessible, practical strategies they can implement immediately"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **School Districts & Administrators**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Searching for whole-school SEL implementation partners"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Require proven methodologies for sustainable adult learning"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Want measurable outcomes and impact data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Looking for long-term strategic partnerships"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Students & Community Members**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Benefit from improved educational environments"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Experience transformed learning spaces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Gain enhanced college and career readiness"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Develop stronger social-emotional skills"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Education Organizations & Partners**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Seek collaboration opportunities"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Want to leverage NewRoot's expertise and methodologies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Looking to expand their impact through strategic alliances"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Need evidence-based approaches to SEL implementation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
