      "id": "b-178",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To ensure a smooth migration from WordPress to Webflow, we require secure access to the following systems and credentials. All credentials will be handled with strict confidentiality and documented in a shared password manager. Services that have not been granted access are marked as unchecked."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
