    {
      "id": "b-231",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Additional Services"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-232",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any relevant API keys or external service integrations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-233",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Third-party service credentials used for critical site functionality"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Note: All credentials should be current and include administrative-level access where applicable. NewRoot Learning Institute will maintain ownership and control of all accounts, with our team requesting specific access permissions as needed during the migration process."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5.3. MemberPress Migration Considerations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Managing memberships is a critical component of NewRoot's current website functionality, and the migration from WordPress to Webflow presents specific challenges and opportunities in this area. Below are the key considerations and open questions we need to address to ensure a smooth transition with minimal disruption for NewRoot's active members while maintaining robust functionality post-migration."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-239",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open Questions:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-241",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-240",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Membership Transition**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-242",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- The current setup in WordPress uses **MemberPress** to manage access to exclusive resources and training materials."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-243",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Webflow has limited native membership functionality, so we’ll need to supplement it with a third-party tool like **MemberStack** or **MemberSpace**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-245",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-244",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Active Members During Transition**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-246",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- How do we handle **active memberships** during the migration?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-247",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We may need to securely export/import user data and notify members in advance about any potential disruption."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-248",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- In case of disruption, we will need to work with NewRoot to ensure that members are notified and their access is restored as soon as possible. A newsletter service like Brevo or Mailchimp will be most effective for sending out these alerts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-250",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-249",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**User Experience Post-Migration**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-251",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- What level of access control does NewRoot need moving forward? For example, will they need tiered memberships or specific access to content?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-252",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Are there any automated communications (e.g., renewal notices) tied to the current system that we need to replicate in Webflow?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-254",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-253",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data Integrity**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-255",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Ensuring member data (e.g., payment history, subscription details) migrates accurately is critical. What’s our fallback plan if certain data formats don’t transfer seamlessly?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-256",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-257",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6.1. Content Management During Migration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-265",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-258",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Three-week content freeze during final migration phase to ensure data integrity"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-259",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Emergency content updates handled through staging environment with 24-hour turnaround"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-260",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Weekly sync meetings with NewRoot content team to coordinate changes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-261",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Git-based version control for all content and code changes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-262",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Content audit and cleanup prior to migration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-263",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Automated content validation post-migration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-264",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Rollback procedures documented and tested"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-266",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Training & Documentation**"
        }
